WEBVTT

00:01:43.720 --> 00:01:44.930
I knew for sure

00:01:45.560 --> 00:01:47.440
that you'd grab my hand.

00:01:50.020 --> 00:01:51.270
Sorry!

00:02:08.750 --> 00:02:10.960
Amazing, Sea King Retsu!

00:02:11.710 --> 00:02:13.460
How cowardly, Japan!

00:02:14.050 --> 00:02:16.300
What cowardice!

00:02:16.550 --> 00:02:20.720
He uses a friendly handshake
to make a surprise attack!

00:02:21.300 --> 00:02:23.140
This is an unforgivable act!

00:02:27.020 --> 00:02:29.230
He's a rare, despicable sneak.

00:02:29.810 --> 00:02:31.810
What will you do, Sea King Retsu?

00:02:32.690 --> 00:02:35.820
How will you fight him, Sea King Retsu?

00:02:39.320 --> 00:02:42.700
Oh boy, I'm at a loss for words!

00:02:42.780 --> 00:02:44.990
Who would have guessed
he would try a third time!

00:02:45.830 --> 00:02:46.830
Retsu.

00:02:48.040 --> 00:02:49.330
Can you shake my hand?

00:02:51.080 --> 00:02:53.000
Let him have it, Retsu!

00:02:53.590 --> 00:02:55.250
Give him a surprise attack!

00:02:58.590 --> 00:03:01.180
Do you have the guts to grab my hand?

00:03:02.340 --> 00:03:04.760
That's a right hand filled with malice.

00:03:04.850 --> 00:03:07.270
That's a smile filled with malice.

00:03:07.770 --> 00:03:09.730
Don't be fooled, Sea King Retsu!

00:03:11.230 --> 00:03:12.900
Look at that!

00:03:13.270 --> 00:03:15.320
Sea King Retsu grabbed his hand.

00:03:15.400 --> 00:03:19.280
Sea King Retsu went along with it.
Surprise attacks mean nothing.

00:03:19.860 --> 00:03:21.280
Do whatever you can,

00:03:21.950 --> 00:03:24.070
Sea King Retsu, our hero.

00:03:36.380 --> 00:03:39.050
It's a steel fist of fury!

00:03:43.130 --> 00:03:46.550
I knew for sure...

00:03:51.140 --> 00:03:53.650
that you'd grab my hand.

00:04:05.370 --> 00:04:06.370
It broke!

00:04:14.870 --> 00:04:15.710
Come on.

00:04:18.040 --> 00:04:18.960
Get up.

00:04:20.300 --> 00:04:22.170
Get up and fight me.

00:04:28.050 --> 00:04:29.430
Are you kidding me?

00:04:29.510 --> 00:04:30.970
You fucking cheater!

00:04:31.560 --> 00:04:32.730
Kill him!

00:04:33.310 --> 00:04:34.600
Don't let him live!

00:04:35.230 --> 00:04:36.400
Beat him to death!

00:04:36.730 --> 00:04:37.730
Make it a bloodbath!

00:04:42.070 --> 00:04:43.240
Get out!

00:04:44.570 --> 00:04:47.160
This is no place for you people!

00:04:48.620 --> 00:04:51.740
Only martial arts masters may stand here.

00:04:52.080 --> 00:04:53.370
I will beat you down

00:04:53.450 --> 00:04:56.250
with my full strength
if you don't leave now!

00:05:03.760 --> 00:05:05.800
You don't need to worry about me.

00:05:06.760 --> 00:05:08.260
I can't use my right hand.

00:05:09.100 --> 00:05:10.560
It's the perfect handicap.

00:05:12.850 --> 00:05:15.390
Now, return to your seats.

00:05:20.860 --> 00:05:22.280
You're right.

00:05:22.860 --> 00:05:26.740
Between you and me,
a one-arm handicap finally makes it fair.

00:05:27.700 --> 00:05:30.660
This was my goal from the start.

00:05:31.370 --> 00:05:34.080
I apologize for repeatedly being rude.

00:05:37.000 --> 00:05:40.130
I don't mind, I already knew
when I took action.

00:05:46.720 --> 00:05:47.590
Let's begin.

00:05:48.300 --> 00:05:50.050
I sincerely vow

00:05:50.640 --> 00:05:52.390
that I'll take you to Japan.

00:05:53.390 --> 00:05:55.810
And alongside me,

00:05:56.390 --> 00:05:58.350
we'll guide those lost souls.

00:06:10.660 --> 00:06:11.950
He grabbed it!

00:06:12.160 --> 00:06:13.580
With his toes!

00:06:18.710 --> 00:06:19.830
<i>This...</i>

00:06:21.670 --> 00:06:23.170
That's amazing.

00:06:24.300 --> 00:06:25.590
<i>This is magnificent!</i>

00:06:41.440 --> 00:06:46.360
<i>How magnificent. I'm touched by you</i>

00:06:47.820 --> 00:06:50.110
<i>and your mastery of so many techniques.</i>

00:06:50.950 --> 00:06:52.740
Oh boy, it's Sea King Jaku!

00:06:52.820 --> 00:06:55.200
Sea King Retsu kicks by using
his pivot leg,

00:06:55.280 --> 00:06:56.870
but his ankle has been caught.

00:06:59.660 --> 00:07:01.620
Sanyinjiao <i>pressure pain.</i>

00:07:03.580 --> 00:07:07.090
<i>Ten centimeters above</i>
<i>the inner part of the ankle</i>

00:07:07.630 --> 00:07:09.340
<i>is the foot's spleen channel,</i>

00:07:09.970 --> 00:07:11.680
<i>the foot's liver meridian,</i>

00:07:12.470 --> 00:07:14.470
<i>and the foot's kidney meridian.</i>

00:07:15.010 --> 00:07:18.930
<i>These three pass through</i>
<i>a vital point called the</i> sanyinjiao.

00:07:19.730 --> 00:07:21.390
<i>If you constrict this part,</i>

00:07:21.980 --> 00:07:25.900
<i>an intense pain passes through,</i>
<i>knocking down even a large man.</i>

00:07:26.610 --> 00:07:28.030
<i>I want you.</i>

00:07:28.860 --> 00:07:30.400
<i>I want you no matter what!</i>

00:07:32.070 --> 00:07:34.160
<i>I'll bring this genius to Japan.</i>

00:07:48.590 --> 00:07:50.470
<i>I absolutely can't lose!</i>

00:07:51.010 --> 00:07:54.760
Absolutely incredible, Sea King Retsu.

00:07:54.840 --> 00:07:59.310
He has shown us this toe-throwing move
not once but twice.

00:07:59.680 --> 00:08:03.020
There's nothing impossible
for this iron-man.

00:08:03.390 --> 00:08:05.690
Please take a look at Jaku's face.

00:08:05.770 --> 00:08:08.940
Only a few hairs remain
of his beloved beard.

00:08:13.150 --> 00:08:14.160
Retsu.

00:08:15.280 --> 00:08:16.950
He's starting a chat.

00:08:17.030 --> 00:08:18.700
That man is always like this.

00:08:18.780 --> 00:08:20.750
When he can't win through skill,

00:08:20.830 --> 00:08:24.330
he uses the art of persuasion,
or in other words, his lies.

00:08:24.420 --> 00:08:26.830
That's how he got here today.

00:08:27.790 --> 00:08:30.460
I'd like to heal your injured elbow.

00:08:32.970 --> 00:08:36.470
Wow! He's offering to heal him
in this situation.

00:08:36.890 --> 00:08:40.350
My martial arts style
isn't meant for hurting people.

00:08:41.310 --> 00:08:43.480
Therefore, your elbow joint

00:08:44.100 --> 00:08:45.520
isn't really broken.

00:08:46.190 --> 00:08:47.480
But it is dislocated.

00:08:48.020 --> 00:08:49.320
Don't be fooled!

00:08:49.820 --> 00:08:52.360
Only I can fix it.

00:08:54.900 --> 00:08:55.740
Your hand.

00:08:57.280 --> 00:08:58.700
What a guy.

00:08:59.080 --> 00:09:01.370
His smooth, eloquent words are back again!

00:09:01.620 --> 00:09:04.500
Brush away that coward's hand,
Sea King Retsu!

00:09:05.290 --> 00:09:06.420
Come on.

00:09:07.580 --> 00:09:10.000
It's a trap!

00:09:11.710 --> 00:09:14.720
Oh, no. He does it again.

00:09:16.090 --> 00:09:17.840
I noticed something.

00:09:18.840 --> 00:09:21.510
Let his hand go, Sea King Retsu.

00:09:22.680 --> 00:09:25.520
There's no point in fighting
a one-handed opponent.

00:09:26.100 --> 00:09:28.020
I want to spread the word about my dream,

00:09:28.850 --> 00:09:30.770
the perfect self-defense.

00:09:31.360 --> 00:09:34.490
If I can't defend against
one measly martial artist...

00:09:34.900 --> 00:09:36.360
the technique is pointless.

00:09:37.610 --> 00:09:39.780
I knew it!

00:09:40.370 --> 00:09:44.080
You should've said something, you coward!

00:09:54.630 --> 00:09:55.720
Does it hurt?

00:10:04.520 --> 00:10:07.060
These two are a riot.

00:10:08.810 --> 00:10:10.020
Let's start over.

00:10:11.110 --> 00:10:12.150
I won't thank you.

00:10:13.190 --> 00:10:14.070
Also...

00:10:14.650 --> 00:10:17.240
the way you said "a measly martial artist"

00:10:17.570 --> 00:10:18.400
bothered me.

00:10:18.900 --> 00:10:22.410
Even if you're Sea King Retsu,
it's merely just Kenpo.

00:10:25.080 --> 00:10:26.080
<i>With my whole body...</i>

00:10:29.460 --> 00:10:31.580
<i>and my entire soul.</i>

00:10:32.670 --> 00:10:34.670
<i>This is scary!</i>

00:10:36.460 --> 00:10:37.970
<i>I'll break you down.</i>

00:10:39.630 --> 00:10:42.010
<i>To defeat boldly and beautifully...</i>

00:10:42.680 --> 00:10:45.100
<i>To vanquish with a calm, collected mind...</i>

00:10:46.220 --> 00:10:48.680
<i>If that were in any way possible,</i>

00:10:49.390 --> 00:10:51.350
<i>that's how I would've done it.</i>

00:10:53.190 --> 00:10:54.360
<i>If it were possible...</i>

00:10:56.530 --> 00:10:59.110
<i>My opponent is the genius, Sea King Retsu.</i>

00:10:59.490 --> 00:11:03.280
<i>In other words, the culmination</i>
<i>of 4,000 years of Chinese martial arts.</i>

00:11:03.950 --> 00:11:05.120
<i>I can't win.</i>

00:11:07.290 --> 00:11:08.950
<i>If I can't win, then...</i>

00:11:16.750 --> 00:11:17.840
<i>I'll defend.</i>

00:11:18.380 --> 00:11:20.590
<i>I'll defend myself.</i>

00:11:27.100 --> 00:11:29.140
This isn't a proper match.

00:11:33.480 --> 00:11:34.610
<i>Self-defense...</i>

00:11:36.900 --> 00:11:38.280
<i>doesn't mean defeat.</i>

00:11:38.360 --> 00:11:39.650
What...

00:11:40.860 --> 00:11:41.820
What?

00:11:41.900 --> 00:11:42.860
Really?

00:11:44.120 --> 00:11:46.030
Is he throwing the match?

00:11:46.490 --> 00:11:48.540
That old man is amazing.

00:11:49.200 --> 00:11:50.660
That's no ordinary method.

00:11:57.250 --> 00:11:58.340
What's this?

00:12:00.010 --> 00:12:01.840
The attacks stopped.

00:12:02.720 --> 00:12:04.680
Have you thrown the match?

00:12:07.010 --> 00:12:10.810
I did it!

00:12:12.520 --> 00:12:15.600
I won!

00:12:31.370 --> 00:12:34.370
Retsu, focusing on strength alone
is boring.

00:12:34.460 --> 00:12:35.710
It's foolish.

00:12:58.940 --> 00:13:00.270
Isn't it over already?

00:13:00.610 --> 00:13:02.570
<i>No! It isn't over yet.</i>

00:13:03.400 --> 00:13:05.400
<i>It is in no way over yet.</i>

00:13:06.410 --> 00:13:11.330
<i>Your back can withstand nine times</i>
<i>more damage than your front.</i>

00:13:12.370 --> 00:13:16.290
<i>If Sea King Jaku was facing forward,</i>
<i>he would've fallen long ago.</i>

00:13:17.080 --> 00:13:18.710
<i>He has accumulated damage,</i>

00:13:19.080 --> 00:13:21.960
<i>but he still stays conscious</i>
<i>due to this fact.</i>

00:13:23.340 --> 00:13:25.340
<i>Self-protection enlightenment.</i>

00:13:45.440 --> 00:13:46.280
Forgive me.

00:13:46.360 --> 00:13:47.280
What?

00:13:59.710 --> 00:14:01.790
<i>When did I stand up?</i>

00:14:04.880 --> 00:14:05.880
Oh, no!

00:14:06.050 --> 00:14:06.880
Damn...

00:14:07.800 --> 00:14:08.630
it.

00:14:46.880 --> 00:14:48.340
We have a winner!

00:14:49.090 --> 00:14:51.470
Yes!

00:14:52.180 --> 00:14:53.890
China is the best!

00:14:54.680 --> 00:14:56.350
China is number one!

00:14:57.060 --> 00:14:59.940
I punched and kicked with all my might.

00:15:00.940 --> 00:15:03.440
I took my shoes off and used my toes.

00:15:03.980 --> 00:15:07.650
I even used a vital spot
that shouldn't be used on lower ranks.

00:15:09.570 --> 00:15:11.700
It's 4,000 years of Chinese martial arts.

00:15:12.360 --> 00:15:15.490
You were hit with a genius's full force.

00:15:16.240 --> 00:15:17.290
Despite that,

00:15:17.830 --> 00:15:20.000
both of your hands still persist.

00:15:22.960 --> 00:15:28.260
<i>This is no victory.</i>
<i>An upright man, Sea King Jaku.</i>

00:15:29.550 --> 00:15:30.840
<i>You defended until the end.</i>

00:15:31.630 --> 00:15:33.760
<i>You are a true winner.</i>

00:15:48.860 --> 00:15:50.320
Amazing, Sea King Jaku!

00:15:50.400 --> 00:15:51.780
Good job, Retsu!

00:15:58.290 --> 00:16:00.750
Hurry up and get this hero medical care.

00:16:04.380 --> 00:16:05.880
He was cheap and played dirty.

00:16:06.130 --> 00:16:08.300
Most of all, he was beautiful.

00:16:11.170 --> 00:16:12.800
Hey, Retsu!

00:16:13.590 --> 00:16:16.140
Please, come to Japan with me.

00:16:16.550 --> 00:16:17.550
Please?

00:16:19.720 --> 00:16:21.180
Hey, I'm an injured man.

00:16:22.020 --> 00:16:23.560
<i>What a guy.</i>

00:16:24.190 --> 00:16:27.230
I won't give up!

00:16:33.490 --> 00:16:34.360
I apologize.

00:16:35.570 --> 00:16:37.570
Because of my failure,

00:16:38.580 --> 00:16:42.500
our team's dream of getting
a perfect win has crumbled.

00:16:43.660 --> 00:16:47.000
This may sound rude, Jaku,
but I'm honestly surprised.

00:16:47.080 --> 00:16:48.000
What?

00:16:49.250 --> 00:16:50.750
You fought so persistently.

00:16:52.970 --> 00:16:54.970
<i>Even if you search the entire world,</i>

00:16:55.680 --> 00:16:58.760
<i>there might not be anyone</i>
<i>who can beat Sea King Retsu.</i>

00:16:59.600 --> 00:17:02.220
It was fantastic how you pulled him into

00:17:02.310 --> 00:17:04.520
your forte, psychological warfare.

00:17:05.440 --> 00:17:07.020
It was my only choice.

00:17:07.560 --> 00:17:08.860
It was a good choice.

00:17:26.460 --> 00:17:27.790
Mohammad Alai Jr.

00:17:28.380 --> 00:17:30.210
You've fought him before.

00:17:30.290 --> 00:17:33.300
His fighting style
is different from any other.

00:17:34.090 --> 00:17:36.300
He's big and strong.

00:17:39.300 --> 00:17:40.680
But it's not complete.

00:17:47.770 --> 00:17:49.770
He just uses a hand-to-hand sport.

00:17:50.900 --> 00:17:52.520
He'll understand once we fight.

00:17:59.910 --> 00:18:02.160
But still...

00:18:02.410 --> 00:18:04.580
he calls these fighting movements.

00:18:05.160 --> 00:18:07.000
It looks like a dance.

00:18:09.080 --> 00:18:10.040
<i>Western dance.</i>

00:18:19.680 --> 00:18:22.470
The Chinese Allied Powers, Sea King Han.

00:18:23.390 --> 00:18:27.730
The Japan-US victors' group,
Mohammad Alai Jr.

00:18:30.810 --> 00:18:31.730
Begin!

00:18:45.580 --> 00:18:46.830
<i>It's not a dance!</i>

00:18:55.420 --> 00:18:56.380
He cut him!

00:18:56.880 --> 00:18:58.510
He cut him up in one hit!

00:18:59.840 --> 00:19:01.890
It seems graceful.

00:19:01.970 --> 00:19:03.510
It seems elegant, and yet,

00:19:04.560 --> 00:19:07.020
it's actually a superb fighting style.

00:19:07.720 --> 00:19:11.520
However, in situations like
a densely packed fight,

00:19:11.600 --> 00:19:15.520
it's unnatural to use a style
that only uses hand techniques.

00:19:15.610 --> 00:19:17.110
For example...

00:19:17.280 --> 00:19:18.650
there are no kicks!

00:19:21.610 --> 00:19:25.030
It didn't hit,
but the difference in range is clear.

00:19:25.120 --> 00:19:28.540
As long as I kick,
your hand techniques won't reach me.

00:19:29.960 --> 00:19:30.960
What's more...

00:19:33.170 --> 00:19:37.000
I don't need to explain the gap
between leg and arm power.

00:19:37.590 --> 00:19:38.630
Do you get it?

00:19:39.090 --> 00:19:42.010
You're incomplete.

00:19:42.590 --> 00:19:45.550
Baki, do you agree with his theory?

00:19:48.390 --> 00:19:50.270
Boxing doesn't use kicks.

00:19:51.310 --> 00:19:54.610
There was a time when I believed that too.

00:19:55.980 --> 00:19:57.110
Oh, really?

00:19:57.230 --> 00:19:58.860
So it does use kicks?

00:19:59.780 --> 00:20:02.780
Yes, kicking techniques
do exist in boxing.

00:20:16.380 --> 00:20:17.790
<i>You...</i>

00:20:18.380 --> 00:20:20.090
<i>mere sportsman!</i>

00:20:25.220 --> 00:20:28.810
<i>Yes, kicking techniques</i>
<i>do exist in boxing.</i>

00:20:29.430 --> 00:20:32.180
<i>However, his kicks don't target</i>
<i>his opponent.</i>

00:20:33.310 --> 00:20:35.400
<i>He kicks the ground.</i>

00:20:36.270 --> 00:20:38.440
<i>He kicks the ground.</i>

00:20:39.730 --> 00:20:42.990
<i>Boxing is a combat sport</i>
<i>that kicks the ground.</i>

00:20:47.700 --> 00:20:48.530
Two hits!

00:20:48.620 --> 00:20:52.080
With just two hits,
his opponent has fallen!

00:20:53.750 --> 00:20:54.960
He kicks the ground?

00:20:55.960 --> 00:20:57.000
I see.

00:20:57.380 --> 00:20:59.590
His Kenpo, which comes from boxing,

00:21:00.170 --> 00:21:01.800
includes kicking techniques.

00:21:04.470 --> 00:21:05.340
Wait...

00:21:07.550 --> 00:21:08.550
Wait.

00:21:09.550 --> 00:21:10.640
Please wait.

00:21:12.310 --> 00:21:13.640
He's standing up!

00:21:14.940 --> 00:21:16.350
I can...

00:21:17.850 --> 00:21:20.020
Sea King Han wants to continue.

00:21:21.820 --> 00:21:23.190
I can fight.

00:21:24.190 --> 00:21:25.700
I can still fight!

00:21:29.370 --> 00:21:31.370
Their fight to the death starts again.

00:21:31.950 --> 00:21:33.540
<i>I can't mess up again.</i>

00:21:35.960 --> 00:21:36.830
What?

00:21:46.170 --> 00:21:47.010
Hey.

00:21:51.430 --> 00:21:52.890
You bastard!

00:21:54.890 --> 00:21:55.810
<i>What?</i>

00:21:56.390 --> 00:21:57.310
<i>The floor...</i>

00:21:58.400 --> 00:21:59.230
<i>Why...</i>

00:21:59.980 --> 00:22:02.400
<i>is it getting higher?</i>

00:22:08.490 --> 00:22:09.490
Han.

00:22:12.120 --> 00:22:14.290
<i>I don't get it.</i>

00:22:16.710 --> 00:22:17.790
We have a winner!

00:23:42.290 --> 00:23:43.210
IDIOTS FROM PLANET STRONG

00:23:49.170 --> 00:23:50.970
Subtitle translation by Chul Kim
